<BaseLayout title="Braces Cost & Financing in Memphis | Hoffman Family Orthodontics" description="Understand orthodontic costs, insurance questions, and flexible payment options at Hoffman Family Orthodontics. Start with a complimentary East Memphis consultation.">
<main id="main" class="interior-page">
  <section class="detail-intro"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Cost &amp; financing</p><h1>Let’s make sense<br>of the numbers.</h1><p class="intro-lead">Your smile deserves a clear plan. Dr. Rachel Hoffman and our team will help you understand treatment options, insurance benefits, and payment choices.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/#form">Start with a complimentary consultation</a></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container detail-grid"><aside class="detail-sidebar"><p class="section-kicker">A comfortable place to start</p><p>Your first consultation is complimentary. Bring your questions and your dental insurance information.</p><a class="text-link" href="/new-patients/">What to expect at your first visit</a></aside><div class="detail-body">
    <section class="reading-copy"><h2>How much do braces cost in Memphis?</h2><p>The cost depends on the treatment you need. The type of appliance, the complexity of your bite, and the scope of care all belong in the discussion. A general price you see online may not reflect your own plan.</p><p>After your orthodontic exam, we’ll discuss the recommended approach and its fee. Ask what is included, how insurance affects your share, and whether there are any separate costs to plan for.</p></section>
    <section class="reading-copy"><h2>Make insurance easier to understand.</h2><p>We accept most insurance providers. Orthodontic benefits vary by plan, so bring your insurance information and we’ll help you review it.</p><p>Useful questions include whether your plan covers orthodontics for your age group, whether it has a lifetime benefit limit, and how it handles treatment already in progress. Accepting insurance does not mean every plan covers every treatment or that every provider relationship is in-network.</p></section>
    <section class="reading-copy"><h2>Talk through payment options.</h2><p>Flexible payment plans are available. Our team will discuss options for your treatment and help you understand the payment schedule before you commit.</p><p>Ask about the initial payment, monthly amount, payment period, and any applicable fees or interest. Your consultation is the place to confirm the terms that apply to you.</p></section>
    <section class="reading-copy"><h2>Compare the whole plan.</h2><p>When comparing braces and clear aligners, consider the proposed care, expected visits, and what happens after active treatment. Ask how retainers and follow-up care are handled so you can make an informed decision.</p><div class="inline-links"><a class="text-link" href="/treatments/">Explore treatments</a><a class="text-link" href="/faq/#cost-and-planning">More payment questions</a></div></section>
  </div></div></section><ConsultationCTA title="Bring your questions. We’ll bring clarity." description="Arrange a complimentary consultation at our East Memphis office to discuss your treatment and payment options." />
</main>
</BaseLayout>
